    "kernelLanguage": "r",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 18,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Statistics with R\n\nHypothesis testing, regression, and confidence intervals using built-in R datasets.\n\nNo data download or package installation needed — uses base R only.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## 1. Descriptive Statistics",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "data(mtcars)\ncat(\"Dataset: mtcars (\", nrow(mtcars), \"cars, \", ncol(mtcars), \"variables)\\n\\n\")\nsummary(mtcars[, c(\"mpg\", \"hp\", \"wt\", \"disp\")])",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Dataset: mtcars ( 32 cars,  11 variables)\n\n      mpg              hp              wt             disp      \n Min.   :10.40   Min.   : 52.0   Min.   :1.513   Min.   : 71.1  \n 1st Qu.:15.43   1st Qu.: 96.5   1st Qu.:2.581   1st Qu.:120.8  \n Median :19.20   Median :123.0   Median :3.325   Median :196.3  \n Mean   :20.09   Mean   :146.7   Mean   :3.217   Mean   :230.7  \n 3rd Qu.:22.80   3rd Qu.:180.0   3rd Qu.:3.610   3rd Qu.:326.0  \n Max.   :33.90   Max.   :335.0   Max.   :5.424   Max.   :472.0",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Dataset: mtcars ( 32 cars,  11 variables)\n\n      mpg              hp              wt             disp      \n Min.   :10.40   Min.   : 52.0   Min.   :1.513   Min.   : 71.1  \n 1st Qu.:15.43   1st Qu.: 96.5   1st Qu.:2.581   1st Qu.:120.8  \n Median :19.20   Median :123.0   Median :3.325   Median :196.3  \n Mean   :20.09   Mean   :146.7   Mean   :3.217   Mean   :230.7  \n 3rd Qu.:22.80   3rd Qu.:180.0   3rd Qu.:3.610   3rd Qu.:326.0  \n Max.   :33.90   Max.   :335.0   Max.   :5.424   Max.   :472.0</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 2. Two-Sample t-Test\n\nDo manual-transmission cars get better MPG than automatics?",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "auto <- mtcars$mpg[mtcars$am == 0]\nmanual <- mtcars$mpg[mtcars$am == 1]\n\ncat(\"Automatic:\", round(mean(auto), 1), \"mpg (n =\", length(auto), \")\\n\")\ncat(\"Manual:   \", round(mean(manual), 1), \"mpg (n =\", length(manual), \")\\n\\n\")\n\nt_result <- t.test(manual, auto, alternative = \"greater\")\nprint(t_result)\n\ncat(\"\\nConclusion:\",\n    ifelse(t_result$p.value < 0.05,\n           \"Reject H0 — manual cars have significantly higher MPG\",\n           \"Fail to reject H0\"))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Automatic: 17.1 mpg (n = 19 )\nManual:    24.4 mpg (n = 13 )\n\n\n\tWelch Two Sample t-test\n\ndata:  manual and auto\nt = 3.7671, df = 18.332, p-value = 0.0006868\nalternative hypothesis: true difference in means is greater than 0\n95 percent confidence interval:\n 3.913256      Inf\nsample estimates:\nmean of x mean of y \n 24.39231  17.14737 \n\n\nConclusion: Reject H0 — manual cars have significantly higher MPG",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Automatic: 17.1 mpg (n = 19 )\nManual:    24.4 mpg (n = 13 )\n\n\n\tWelch Two Sample t-test\n\ndata:  manual and auto\nt = 3.7671, df = 18.332, p-value = 0.0006868\nalternative hypothesis: true difference in means is greater than 0\n95 percent confidence interval:\n 3.913256      Inf\nsample estimates:\nmean of x mean of y \n 24.39231  17.14737 \n\n\nConclusion: Reject H0 — manual cars have significantly higher MPG</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "## 3. Chi-Squared Test\n\nAre cylinder count and transmission type independent?",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "tab <- table(Cylinders = mtcars$cyl, Transmission = mtcars$am)\ncolnames(tab) <- c(\"Automatic\", \"Manual\")\nprint(tab)\ncat(\"\\n\")\nchisq.test(tab)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "         Transmission\nCylinders Automatic Manual\n        4         3      8\n        6         4      3\n        8        12      2\n\nWarning in chisq.test(tab) : Chi-squared approximation may be incorrect\n\n\tPearson's Chi-squared test\n\ndata:  tab\nX-squared = 8.7407, df = 2, p-value = 0.01265",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">         Transmission\nCylinders Automatic Manual\n        4         3      8\n        6         4      3\n        8        12      2\n\nWarning in chisq.test(tab) : Chi-squared approximation may be incorrect\n\n\tPearson's Chi-squared test\n\ndata:  tab\nX-squared = 8.7407, df = 2, p-value = 0.01265</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "## 4. Multiple Linear Regression",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "model <- lm(mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\nsummary(model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "\nCall:\nlm(formula = mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\n\nResiduals:\n    Min      1Q  Median      3Q     Max \n-3.4221 -1.7924 -0.3788  1.2249  5.5317 \n\nCoefficients:\n             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(>|t|)    \n(Intercept) 34.002875   2.642659  12.867 2.82e-13 ***\nwt          -2.878575   0.904971  -3.181 0.003574 ** \nhp          -0.037479   0.009605  -3.902 0.000546 ***\nam           2.083710   1.376420   1.514 0.141268    \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nResidual standard error: 2.538 on 28 degrees of freedom\nMultiple R-squared:  0.8399,\tAdjusted R-squared:  0.8227 \nF-statistic: 48.96 on 3 and 28 DF,  p-value: 2.908e-11",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">\nCall:\nlm(formula = mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\n\nResiduals:\n    Min      1Q  Median      3Q     Max \n-3.4221 -1.7924 -0.3788  1.2249  5.5317 \n\nCoefficients:\n             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(&gt;|t|)    \n(Intercept) 34.002875   2.642659  12.867 2.82e-13 ***\nwt          -2.878575   0.904971  -3.181 0.003574 ** \nhp          -0.037479   0.009605  -3.902 0.000546 ***\nam           2.083710   1.376420   1.514 0.141268    \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nResidual standard error: 2.538 on 28 degrees of freedom\nMultiple R-squared:  0.8399,\tAdjusted R-squared:  0.8227 \nF-statistic: 48.96 on 3 and 28 DF,  p-value: 2.908e-11</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## 5. Regression Diagnostics",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "par(mfrow = c(2, 2))\nplot(model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/205d298a-efbc-4f9c-8482-f81f6d4e9f9f\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "## 6. Confidence Intervals",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "ci <- confint(model, level = 0.95)\ncat(\"95% Confidence Intervals:\\n\")\nprint(round(ci, 4))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "95% Confidence Intervals:\n              2.5 %  97.5 %\n(Intercept) 28.5896 39.4161\nwt          -4.7323 -1.0248\nhp          -0.0572 -0.0178\nam          -0.7358  4.9032",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">95% Confidence Intervals:\n              2.5 %  97.5 %\n(Intercept) 28.5896 39.4161\nwt          -4.7323 -1.0248\nhp          -0.0572 -0.0178\nam          -0.7358  4.9032</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "coefs <- coef(model)[-1]\nci_vals <- ci[-1, ]\nn <- length(coefs)\n\npar(mfrow = c(1, 1), mar = c(5, 8, 4, 2))\nplot(coefs, 1:n, xlim = range(ci_vals),\n     pch = 19, col = \"#58a6ff\", cex = 1.5,\n     yaxt = \"n\", xlab = \"Estimate\", ylab = \"\",\n     main = \"95% Confidence Intervals for Coefficients\")\naxis(2, at = 1:n, labels = names(coefs), las = 1)\nsegments(ci_vals[, 1], 1:n, ci_vals[, 2], 1:n,\n         lwd = 3, col = \"#58a6ff\")\nabline(v = 0, lty = 2, col = \"#f85149\", lwd = 1.5)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/39a662f8-4454-4fbd-8e70-7daf290e7b57\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "## 7. One-Way ANOVA\n\nDoes MPG differ significantly across cylinder counts?",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "anova_model <- aov(mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\nsummary(anova_model)\ncat(\"\\nTukey HSD Post-hoc Comparisons:\\n\")\nTukeyHSD(anova_model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "            Df Sum Sq Mean Sq F value   Pr(>F)    \nfactor(cyl)  2  824.8   412.4    39.7 4.98e-09 ***\nResiduals   29  301.3    10.4                     \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nTukey HSD Post-hoc Comparisons:\n  Tukey multiple comparisons of means\n    95% family-wise confidence level\n\nFit: aov(formula = mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\n\n$`factor(cyl)`\n          diff        lwr        upr     p adj\n6-4  -6.920779 -10.769350 -3.0722086 0.0003424\n8-4 -11.563636 -14.770779 -8.3564942 0.0000000\n8-6  -4.642857  -8.327583 -0.9581313 0.0112287",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">            Df Sum Sq Mean Sq F value   Pr(&gt;F)    \nfactor(cyl)  2  824.8   412.4    39.7 4.98e-09 ***\nResiduals   29  301.3    10.4                     \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nTukey HSD Post-hoc Comparisons:\n  Tukey multiple comparisons of means\n    95% family-wise confidence level\n\nFit: aov(formula = mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\n\n$`factor(cyl)`\n          diff        lwr        upr     p adj\n6-4  -6.920779 -10.769350 -3.0722086 0.0003424\n8-4 -11.563636 -14.770779 -8.3564942 0.0000000\n8-6  -4.642857  -8.327583 -0.9581313 0.0112287</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "boxplot(mpg ~ cyl, data = mtcars,\n        main = \"MPG by Cylinder Count\",\n        xlab = \"Cylinders\", ylab = \"Miles per Gallon\",\n        col = c(\"#58a6ff\", \"#a371f7\", \"#f85149\"))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/3b66cc39-000a-467e-b1b2-30b049c8cf4e\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "## Summary\n\n- **Welch t-test**: In the unadjusted one-sided comparison, manual-transmission cars have higher mean MPG\n- **Chi-squared**: The contingency table suggests an association, but the small expected counts trigger an approximation warning, so interpret this result cautiously\n- **Regression**: Weight and horsepower are significant negative predictors after adjustment; transmission type is not significant in this model\n- **ANOVA**: MPG differs significantly among the 4-, 6-, and 8-cylinder groups; the Tukey results identify the pairwise differences",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}